 -- Function: df_value_counts (COL)
     Frequency table for a column, returned as a ‘df_table’ with columns
     ‘"value"’ and ‘"count"’, sorted by count descending.  Works on
     string-columns and ndarrays.

* Menu:

     * Examples::

1.3.1.18 Examples
.................

